#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1170
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"As you might have noticed, this has another side effect, making it difficult to "
"kill a process that is causing trouble:"
msgstr ""
"ពេល​ដែល​អ្នក​បាន​ចំណាំ នេះ​មាន​ប្រសិទ្ធិភាព​នៅ​ម្ខាង​ទៀត "
"ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​វា​ពិបាក​ក្នុង​ការ​ពិឃាដ​ដំណើរ​ការ​ដែល​វា​កំពុង​បង្ករ​បញ្ហា ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>killall kdesktop</command></userinput>\n"
"<computeroutput>kdesktop: no process killed</computeroutput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>killall kdesktop</command></userinput>\n"
"<computeroutput>kdesktop ៖ គ្មាន​ដំណើរ​ការ​ដែល​បាន​ពិឃាដ</computeroutput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You might be tempted to try <userinput><command>killall kdeinit</command>"
"</userinput>, but killing all kdeinit processes will have the effect of "
"shutting down all of &kde;. In effect, total destruction!"
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​ប្រហែល​ជា​ចង់​សាកល្បង <userinput><command>killall kdeinit</command>"
"</userinput> ប៉ុន្តែ​ពិឃាដ​ដំណើរ​ការ kdeinit "
"ទាំងអស់​នឹង​មាន​ប្រសិទ្ធិភាព​នៃ​ការ​បិទ KDE ទាំងអស់ ។ ប្រសិទ្ធិភាព "
"បំផ្លាញ​ទាំងអស់ !"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1180
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two simple solutions to this:"
msgstr "នេះ​គឺ​ជា​ដំណោះស្រាយ​ធម្មតា​ពីរ​សម្រាប់ ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kdekillall kdesktop</command></userinput>"
"\n"
"or good old\n"
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kill 26195</command></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kdekillall kdesktop</command></userinput>"
"\n"
"or good old\n"
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>kill 26195</command></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1183
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdekillall</command> is part of the &kde; <acronym>SDK</acronym> "
"package."
msgstr ""
"<command>kdekillall</command> គឺ​ជា​ផ្នែក​នៃ​កញ្ចប់ KDE <acronym>SDK</acronym> "
"។"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Customizing &kde;"
msgstr "ប្ដូរ KDE តាម​បំណង"

