"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Icon=/opt/kde3/share/apps/kdesktop/pics/ksslogo.png\n"
"Type=Link\n"
"URL=http://www.kde.org/"
msgstr ""
"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Encoding=UTF-8\n"
"Icon=/opt/kde3/share/apps/kdesktop/pics/ksslogo.png\n"
"Type=Link\n"
"URL=http://www.kde.org/"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1232
#, no-c-format
msgid "Applications"
msgstr "កម្មវិធី"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:1234
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Links to Applications using <literal role=\"extension\">.desktop</literal> "
"file: <menuchoice><guimenu>Create New</guimenu><guisubmenu>File</guisubmenu>"
"<guimenuitem>Link to Application</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
". You must provide details yourself. Drag from &kde; Menu: Either copy or link "
"(creates symlink), much easier"
msgstr ""
"តភ្ជាប់​ទៅ​កម្មវិធី​ដោយ​ប្រើ​ឯកសារ <literal role=\"extension\">"
".desktop</literal> ៖ <menuchoice><guimenu>បង្កើត​ថ្មី</guimenu><guisubmenu>"
"ឯកសារ</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>តភ្ជាប់​ទៅ​កម្មវិធី</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"។ អ្នក​ត្រូវ​តែ​ផ្ដល់​លម្អិត​ពី​ខ្លួន​អ្នក ។ អូស​ពី​ម៉ឺនុយ KDE ៖ ទាំង​ចម្លង "
"ឬ​តភ្ជាប់ (បង្កើត​តំណ​បង្កប់) ងាយស្រួល​ជាង"

#. Tag: programlisting
