"konsole</option></userinput>\n"
"konsole-9058\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"#!/bin/sh\n"
"konsole=$(dcopstart konsole-script)\n"
"session=$(dcop $konsole konsole currentSession)\n"
"dcop $konsole $session renameSession Local\n"
"\n"
"session=$(dcop $konsole konsole newSession)\n"
"dcop $konsole $session renameSession Remote\n"
"\n"
"session=$(dcop $konsole konsole newSession)\n"
"dcop $konsole $session renameSession Code\n"
"dcop $konsole $session sendSession 'cd /my/work/directory'"

#. Tag: title
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2239
#, no-c-format
msgid "KDialog"
msgstr "KDialog"

#. Tag: subtitle
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2240
#, no-c-format
msgid "<subtitle>&kde; DIY - Building Your Own Tools</subtitle>"
msgstr "<subtitle>KDE DIY - សង់​ឧបករណ៍​ផ្ទាល់ខ្លួន​របស់​អ្នក</subtitle>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2242
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can use &kde; dialogs from your own scripts, to combine the power of &UNIX; "
"shell scripting with the ease of use of &kde;."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ​ប្រអប់ KDE ពី​ស្គ្រីប​ផ្ទាល់​ខ្លួន​របស់​អ្នក "
"ដើម្បី​បន្សំ​ថាមពល​នៃ សែល​យូនីក​ដែល​ស្គ្រីប​ជាមួយ​ភាព​ងាយស្រួល​នៃ​ការ​ប្រើ​នៃ "
"KDE ។"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2245
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>kdialog</command> <option>--msgbox 'You have new "
"mail!'</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><command>kdialog</command> <option>--msgbox "
"'អ្នក​មាន​សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី!'</option></userinput>"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2247
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>kdialog</command> <option>--title 'New Mail'</option> "
"<option>--msgbox 'You have new mail!'</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><command>kdialog</command> <option>--title 'សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី'</option> "
"<option>--msgbox 'អ្នក​មាន​សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី!'</option></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2249
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <application>KDialog</application> part can be replaced via <option>"
"--caption</option> option"
msgstr ""
"ផ្នែក <application>KDialog</application> អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​ជំនួស​តាម​រយៈ​ជម្រើស "
"<option>--caption</option>"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2252
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><command>kdialog</command> <option>--title 'New Mail'</option> "
"<option>--msgbox 'You have new mail!'</option> <option>"
"--dontagain myfile:mykey</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><command>kdialog</command> <option>--title 'សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី'</option> "
"<option>--msgbox 'អ្នក​មាន​សំបុត្រ​ថ្មី!'</option> <option>"
"--dontagain myfile:mykey</option></userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2254
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Saves whether to show again in <filename>$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>"
"/share/config/myfile</filename> (by writing into this file the following lines:"
msgstr ""
"រក្សា​ទុក​ថា​តើ​ត្រូវ​បង្ហាញ​ម្ដង​ទៀត​ក្នុង <filename>$<envar>KDEHOME</envar>"
"/share/config/myfile</filename> "
"(ដោយ​សរសេរ​ទៅ​ក្នុង​ឯកសារ​នេះ​នូវ​បន្ទាត់​ខាងក្រោម ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2258
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"[Notification Messages]\n"
"mykey=false"
msgstr ""
"[Notification Messages]\n"
"mykey=false"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Instead of <option>--msgbox</option> you can also use <option>--sorry</option> "
"and <option>--error</option>, as appropriate. For instance, you might use "
"<command>kdialog</command> <option>--sorry 'The network can not be "
"reached'</option> or <command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--error 'Mail box can not be opened'</option>."
msgstr ""
"ជំនួស <option>--msgbox</option> អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ <option>--sorry</option> "
"និង <option>--error</option> យ៉ាង​ត្រឹមត្រូវ ។ ឧទាហរណ៍ "
"អ្នក​ប្រហែល​ជា​ប្រើ<command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--sorry 'បណ្ដាញ​មិន​ទៅ​ដល់'</option> ឬ <command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--error 'ប្រអប់​សំបុត្រ​អាច​ត្រូវ​បាន​បើក'</option> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2266
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is also possible to create message boxes that accept a yes or no answer."
msgstr "វា​អាច​បង្កើត​ប្រអប់​សារ​ដែល​យល់ព្រម​ទទួល​ចម្លើយ បាទ/ចាស ឬ​ទេ​ផង​ដែរ ។"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2269
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdialog</command> <option>--yesno 'Do you want to connect\n"
"to the Internet?'</option> <command>echo</command> <returnvalue>$?</returnvalue>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kdialog</command> <option>--yesno 'តើ​អ្នក​ចង់​ភ្ជាប់\n"
"ទៅ​អ៊ីនធឺណិត​ឬ ?'</option> <command>echo</command> <returnvalue>$?</returnvalue>"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2275
#, no-c-format
msgid "Return Value"
msgstr "ត្រឡប់​តម្លៃ"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2276
#, no-c-format
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "អត្ថន័យ"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2280
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>0</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>០</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2280
#, no-c-format
msgid "Yes, OK, Continue"
msgstr "បាទ/ចាស យល់ព្រម បន្ត"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2281
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>1</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>១</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2281
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>No</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>ទេ</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2282
#, no-c-format
msgid "<entry>2</entry>"
msgstr "<entry>២</entry>"

#. Tag: entry
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2282
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "បោះបង់"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2287
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Make sure to store the result in a variable if you do not use it directly, the "
"next command will fill $? with a new value You can use <option>"
"--dontagain</option> here as well, it will remember the users choice and "
"returns it the next times without showing the dialog any more."
msgstr ""
"សូម​ប្រាកដ​ដើម្បី​រក្សា​ទុក​លទ្ធិផល​ក្នុង​អថេរ បើ​អ្នក​មិន​ប្រើ​វា​ដោយ​ផ្ទាល់ "
"ពាក្យ​បញ្ជា​បន្ទាប់​នឹង​បំពេញ $? ជាមួយ​និង​តម្លៃ​ថ្មី ដែល​អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ <option>"
"--dontagain</option> នៅ​ទីនេះ​ផង​ដែរ វា​នឹង​ចងចាំ​ជម្រើស​អ្នក​ប្រើ "
"និង​ត្រឡប់​វានៅ​ពេល​ក្រោយ​ដោយ​មិន​បង្ហាញ​ប្រអប់​ទៀតទេ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Further variations are:"
msgstr "ភាព​ខុសគ្នា​បន្ថែម​គឺ ៖"

#. Tag: option
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2296
#, no-c-format
msgid "--warningyesno"
msgstr "--warningyesno"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2298
#, no-c-format
msgid "like <option>--yesno</option> but with a different icon"
msgstr "ដូច​ជា <option>--yesno</option> ប៉ុន្តែ​រូប​តំណាង​ផ្សេង​គ្នា"

#. Tag: option
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2303
#, no-c-format
msgid "--warningcontinuecancel"
msgstr "--warningcontinuecancel"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2304
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With <guibutton>Continue</guibutton> and <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton> buttons."
msgstr "ប៊ូតុង <guibutton>បន្ត</guibutton> និង <guibutton>បោះបង់</guibutton> ។"

#. Tag: option
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2309
#, no-c-format
msgid "--warningyesnocancel"
msgstr "--warningyesnocancel"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2310
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"With <guibutton>Yes</guibutton>, <guibutton>No</guibutton> and <guibutton>"
"Cancel</guibutton> button. For example:"
msgstr ""
"ជាមួយ​ប៊ូតុង <guibutton>បាទ/ចាស</guibutton> <guibutton>ទេ</guibutton> "
"និង <guibutton>បោះបង់</guibutton> ។ ឧទាហរណ៍ ៖"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdialog</command> <option>--warningyesnocancel 'Do you want\n"
"to save the changes?'</option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kdialog</command> <option>--warningyesnocancel 'តើ​អ្នក​ចង់\n"
"រក្សា​ទុក​ការ​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ឬ ?'</option>"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2317
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdialog</command> <option>--inputbox \"Enter your name:\" "
"\"YourName\"</option>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kdialog</command> <option>--inputbox \"បញ្ចូល​ឈ្មោះ​របស់​អ្នក ៖\" "
"\"ឈ្មោះ​របស់​អ្នក\"</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2319
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The result is printed to stdout, to put it in a variable you can use <userinput>"
"name=$(kdialog --inputbox \"Enter your name:\" \"YourName\")</userinput>"
". The last argument is optional, it is used to pre-fill the dialog."
msgstr ""
"លទ្ធិផល​ត្រូវ​បាន​បោះពុម្ព​ទៅ stdout "
"ដើម្បី​ដាក់​វា​ក្នុង​អថេរ​ដែល​អ្នក​អាច​ប្រើ <userinput>"
"name=$(kdialog --inputbox \"បញ្ចូល​ឈ្មោះ​របស់​អ្នក ៖\" \"YourName\")</userinput>"
" ។ អាគុយម៉ង់​ចុងក្រោយ​គឺ​ស្រេចចិត្ត "
"វា​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​ដើម្បី​បំពេញ​ប្រអប់​ជាមុយ ។"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2324
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><varname>password</varname>=$(<command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--password \"Enter your password:\"</option>)</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><varname>password</varname>=$(<command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--password \"បញ្ចូល​ពាក្យ​សម្ងាត់ ៖\"</option>)</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2326
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <option>--dontagain</option> option does not work with <option>"
"--inputbox</option> or <option>--password</option>"
msgstr ""
"ជម្រើស <option>--dontagain</option> មិន​ធ្វើការ​ជាមួយ <option>"
"--inputbox</option> ឬ <option>--password</option> ទេ"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2329
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are two dialogs that let the user make a choice from a list:"
msgstr "មាន​ប្រអប់​ពីរ​ដែល​អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​ប្រើ​រើស​ជម្រើស​ពី​បញ្ជី ៖"

#. Tag: option
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2334
#, no-c-format
msgid "--menu"
msgstr "--menu"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2336
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets the user select a single item from a list."
msgstr "អនុញ្ញាត​អ្នក​ប្រើ​ឲ្យ​ជ្រើស​ធាតុ​តែ​មួយ​ពី​បញ្ជី ។"

#. Tag: option
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2340
#, no-c-format
msgid "--checklist"
msgstr "--checklist"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2342
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lets the user select one or more items from a list."
msgstr "អនុញ្ញាត​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​ប្រើ​ជ្រើស​ធាតុ​មួយ ឬ​ច្រើន​ពី​បញ្ជី ។"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2347
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><varname>city</varname>=$(<command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--menu \"Select a city\" a London b Madrid c Paris d Berlin</option>"
")</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><varname>city</varname>=$(<command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--menu \"Select a city\" a London b Madrid c Paris d Berlin</option>"
")</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2349
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<varname>$city</varname> will <returnvalue>a</returnvalue>, <returnvalue>"
"b</returnvalue>, <returnvalue>c</returnvalue> or <returnvalue>d</returnvalue>."
msgstr ""
"<varname>$city</varname> នឹង <returnvalue>a</returnvalue>, <returnvalue>"
"b</returnvalue>, <returnvalue>c</returnvalue> ឬ <returnvalue>d</returnvalue>."

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2351
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput><varname>city</varname>=$(<command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--checklist \"Select cities\" a London off b Madrid on c Paris on d Berlin "
"off</option>)</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput><varname>city</varname>=$(<command>kdialog</command> <option>"
"--checklist \"Select cities\" a London off b Madrid on c Paris on d Berlin "
"off</option>)</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2353
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Madrid and Paris will be pre-selected. The result with Madrid and Paris "
"selected will be <returnvalue>\"b\"</returnvalue> <returnvalue>"
"\"c\"</returnvalue>."
msgstr ""
"ម៉ាឌ្រីដ និង​ប៉ារីស​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ជ្រើស​ជាមុន ។ លទ្ធិផល​ដែល​មាន ម៉ាឌ្រីដ "
"និង​ប៉ារីស​ដែល​បាន​ជ្រើស​នឹង​ជា <returnvalue>\"b\"</returnvalue> <returnvalue>"
"\"c\"</returnvalue> ។"

#. Tag: para
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2357
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you add the <option>--separate-output</option> option, it will put "
"<returnvalue>b</returnvalue> and <returnvalue>c</returnvalue> "
"each on a line of its own, making the result easier to process."
msgstr ""
"បើ​អ្នក​បន្ថែម​ជម្រើស <option>--separate-output</option> "
"វា​នឹង​ដាក់ <returnvalue>b</returnvalue> និង <returnvalue>c</returnvalue> "
"នីមួយៗ​នៅ​លើ​បន្ទាត់​របស់​វា ធ្វើ​ឲ្យ​លទ្ធផល​កាន់​តែ​ងាយស្រួល​ដំណើរ​ការ ។"

#. Tag: screen
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2361
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"file=$(kdialog --getopenfilename $HOME)\n"
"file=$(kdialog --getopenfilename $HOME \"*.png *.jpg|Image Files\")\n"
"file=$(kdialog --getsavefilename $HOME/SaveMe.png)\n"
"file=$(kdialog --getexistingdirectory $HOME)"
msgstr ""
"file=$(kdialog --getopenfilename $HOME)\n"
"file=$(kdialog --getopenfilename $HOME \"*.png *.jpg|Image Files\")\n"
"file=$(kdialog --getsavefilename $HOME/SaveMe.png)\n"
"file=$(kdialog --getexistingdirectory $HOME)"

#. Tag: part
#: kde-for-admins.docbook:2367
#, no-c-format
msgid "&groupware-with-kontact;"
msgstr "groupware-with-kontact"
